}

# S9f/S9d: a List, which has RunFrom, Iter, At and Len, is walked run by run - by "for ... in", by a comprehension and
# in generic code constrained by Indexable - and its iterator's helpers walk its chunks; none of them calls At
test "a List is walked run by run, not by At" { assert passed("listloop") }

